    "text_copy_306365688__362679734": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">As one of our nine employee resource groups, SAFE is a strong and vibrant community that engages the broader organization to help employees feel safe, included and engaged. “In 2020, we issued a challenge to our members and allies to have everyone put&nbsp;pronouns&nbsp;in their email signatures,” Erin says. “We’ve also created an initiative called ‘creating safe spaces' —an introduction to the LGBTQIA+ community at Stryker—which has gotten a lot of traction across the company.”</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Since its inception, SAFE’s leaders have built a strong foundation through employee-driven yearly action plans and seeking the support of external partners who help us make progress towards our <a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/about/diversity-and-inclusion.html\">DE&amp;I commitments</a> over time. SAFE has expanded to include chapters around the globe so that people – and the innovation they make possible – can thrive. “One of the most important things is that we’re listening to people’s experiences,” Erin says. “We’re here to shine a light on issues and take action to create a better experience for every employee.”</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker is proud to be one of the Best Places to Work for LGBTQ+ Equality. Learn more about our diversity, equity and inclusion commitments <a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/about/diversity-and-inclusion.html\">here</a>.</span></span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 20 2022 19:46:51 GMT+0000",
